5763	{"artifactId":"LLD-dced43851723554f-s1","entry":{"id":"migrated-LLD-dced43851723554f-s1-review","actor":{"id":"insrc:daemon","kind":"agent","properties":{}},"timestamp":"2026-10-18T11:15:51.924Z","operation":"review","outcome":{"result":"pass","summary":"review: pass","data":{"kind":"review","report":{"artifact":"design.story","stage":"design.story","verdict":"pass","findings":[{"claimId":"fix-targets-defect.1","ref":"fix-targets-defect","item":"fix-targets-defect","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Durable carry across deletion and conditional backup restoration address both parts of the ISSUE.","evidence":"The ISSUE requests preservation across full index and restoration from backup. fullIndex calls deleteEntitiesForRepo; its transaction calls deleteDocSummaryInTxn before removing entity mappings, followed by deleteDocSummariesForRepo. Carrying summaries before that cascade and restoring by string id and body hash addresses this root cause. The backup path separately addresses summaries already lost. [files: docs/standalone/keep-document-summaries-across-full-index-E20261018dced4385/ISSUE.md, src/indexer/index.ts, src/db/entities.ts, src/db/doc-summaries.ts]","action":"Implement both paths as specified.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"current-behaviour.1","ref":"current-behaviour","item":"current-behaviour","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Full indexing currently deletes summaries and has a restart-recovery window before beginFullIndexState.","evidence":"fullIndex executes 'await deleteEntitiesForRepo(...)', then 'await deleteUnresolvedForRepo(...)', then 'await beginFullIndexState(repoPath)'. beginFullIndexState sets fullIndexFinished=false. Startup checks '(await readIndexState(repo.path))?.fullIndexFinished !== true'; an already-indexed repository interrupted before that flag changes can miss recovery. Both summary cascades described by the design are present. [files: src/indexer/index.ts, src/db/index-state.ts, src/db/entities.ts, src/db/doc-summaries.ts]","action":"Keep markFullIndexUnfinished before deletion and restoration before finishFullIndexState.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"change-sites.1","ref":"change-sites","item":"change-sites","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The design identifies the production callers affected by the deletion and conditional-write contract changes.","evidence":"Repository-wide search finds three production deleteEntitiesForRepo callers: fullIndex, the repo.remove handler, and removeRepo. The two production writeDocSummaryIfCurrent calls are the summariser's placeholder and successful-write branches. Reading these callers confirms the proposed options and overloads cover them. detachDeleteEntities explicitly returns on an empty entity list before invoking its hook, validating the separate carry-cleanup requirement. [files: src/db/entities.ts, src/db/repos.ts, src/daemon/index.ts, src/indexer/index.ts, src/analyze/summariser/driver.ts, src/db/__tests__/entities-return-to-pending.test.ts]","action":"Retain empty-repository cleanup outside the detach hook and update the exact-result assertions identified in the design.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"preserved-behaviour.1","ref":"preserved-behaviour","item":"preserved-behaviour","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The existing atomic body-hash guard, summariser skip rule, and sweep classification support the proposed preservation contract.","evidence":"writeDocSummaryIfCurrent resolves the id, reads the entity and compares sha256(body) inside withWriteTxn. summariseDoc skips only when contentHash and modelId match and errorCode is undefined. The sweep classifies a failed result with another defined skipped value through 'if (res.skipped !== undefined) return skipped'. Thus kept-good fits the existing classification without changing successful writes or the skip rule. [files: src/db/doc-summaries.ts, src/analyze/summariser/driver.ts, src/indexer/doc-summary-sweep.ts, src/db/__tests__/doc-summaries-lmdb.test.ts, src/analyze/summariser/__tests__/summarise-doc-current.test.ts]","action":"Preserve the public wrapper's caller-supplied repository validation when extracting the helper; existing tests explicitly require an unregistered caller repository to throw.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"tests.1","ref":"tests","item":"tests","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The proposed acceptance tests exercise meaningful failure cases for ac1–ac4 using existing test seams.","evidence":"The real full-index fixture supports repeated indexing, verifies changed entity numbers, and uses an Interrupted subclass plus a RecordingQueue to check startup recovery. The summariser fixture's fake model runs an injected callback before returning or throwing, supporting the restored-summary race. Against current code, unchanged-summary retention and interruption recovery lose summaries, the restore IPC is absent, and a failed model overwrites a concurrently stored good summary. These provide discriminating tests for ac1–ac4. [files: src/indexer/__tests__/full-index-rebuild.test.ts, src/analyze/summariser/__tests__/summarise-doc-current.test.ts, src/daemon/__tests__/helpers/seeded-daemon.ts, src/db/doc-summaries.ts, src/analyze/summariser/driver.ts]","action":"Implement the proposed tests and run them. This verifies the test plan, not passing execution: the carry/restore test files and new race cases are not yet present.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"}],"counts":{"high":0,"med":0,"low":5,"unverified":0},"template":"design-issue","reviewedAt":"2026-10-18T11:15:51.924Z","model":"cli-codex:gpt-6-astra","reviewedBy":"daemon"},"resolutions":{}}}}}
